      "filename": "An Old Well, Hobbiton Movie Set, Matamata, New Zealand 2016 (50797299096).jpg",
      "title": "File:An Old Well, Hobbiton Movie Set, Matamata, New Zealand 2016 (50797299096).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/An_Old_Well%2C_Hobbiton_Movie_Set%2C_Matamata%2C_New_Zealand_2016_%2850797299096%29.jpg",
